          "kicker": "Champions Cup",
          "heading": "Théo Attissogbe inspires club Pau to 41-17 Champions Cup win over Leicester",
          "body": "France star Théo Attissogbe inspired a club win as Pau beat Leicester Tigers 41-17 in the Investec Champions Cup at Stade du Hameau. Pau trailed 10-3 early before going in 17-10 up at half-time, then scored 24 points to Leicester's seven after the break. Axel Desperes added 16 points from the boot, and Planet Rugby credited Attissogbe's brilliance with turning the match Pau's way."
