          "kicker": "Injury blow",
          "heading": "Jack Conan sidelined for a spell, adding to Farrell's November concerns",
          "body": "Jack Conan will be sidelined after being injured in Leinster's 48-23 Champions Cup win at Clermont, the back-row having scored a second-half try before going off. Leo Cullen said: \"He will be out for a little bit with that, I'd say.\" The timing is awkward for Andy Farrell, who already has captain Caelan Doris set to miss November's Nations Championship fixtures. Conan has not yet been ruled out of Ireland's November games. Cullen confirmed Jamison Gibson-Park came through training without major problems and could return against Munster."
        },
